  "description": "Non-material amendment to planning permission reference 230208 granted on 7th June 2024 for the demolition of the existing building and construction of new buildings ranging from 3 to 6 storeys to provide commercial floorspace (Use Class E); student accommodation, public realm and amenity spaces; refuse and recycling facilities; cycle parking; servicing, plant; highway improvements and other associated works. Effect of the amendment would be the following: 1. Basement size revised to optimise MEP layout; and2. Core flipped from B01 to L05; and3. New fire escape routes (x2) add to the ground level; and4. New design for the entrance/office/amenity area at ground level; and5. Adjustment to substation location at ground level fronting onto Brunner Road; and6. Adjustment to generator location at ground level in SW corner; and7. 6No. studio rooms changes to a 6 bed cluster flat from level 1 to level 3 in SW corner; and8. 2No. studio rooms changed to 1No. 2 bed cluster from level 1 to level 5; and9. 1No 7 bed cluster changed to 1No. 6 bed cluster flat at level 5; and10. Reduction in number of windows; and&nbsp;11. ASHP plant zone moved on the roof plan; and12. Amendments to the circulation and servicing areas; and13. Amendments to the elevations to reflect changes above.",
